/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 130 0 R
/E (AIT was founded in 1994, as a result of the vision, and untiring efforts of Late Gen. B.C. Joshi PVSM, AVSM, ADC for the children of all ranks of the Indian Army. The lush green campus, its resilience and architectural splendor, and state of the art infrastructure, all provde vital ingredients for a delectable academic environment for the development of total quality engineers. AIT is ranked 139 in NIRF across India. AIT runs Undergraduate courses in Comp. Engg., IT, Mech, E&TC and Post Graduate course in Machine Design. All courses are affiliated to SPPU.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [2]
>>
