/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 131 0 R
/T (The conference will benefit stakeholders by providing a platform for presenting and discussing cutting-edge research in quantum technologies, communication systems, and intelligent applications. Researchers and students gain visibility, feedback, and networking opportunities, while industry partners can explore emerging technologies and foster collaborations. IEEE and its technical communities strengthen engagement and outreach, and the host institution enhances its academic reputation and global partnerships. Overall, the conference promotes innovation, interdisciplinary collaboration, and the advancement of quantum-enabled systems for both industry and society.)
